इष्टोऽसि मे दृढमिति ततो वक्ष्यामि ते हितम् ॥ ६४ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4809,\"bb\":4207,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/64/b4207/\",\"body_value\":\"sarva-guhyatamaṁ bhūyaḥ
śṛṇu me paramaṁ vacaḥ
iṣṭo ’si me dṛḍham iti
tato vakṣyāmi te hitam\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4810,\"bb\":4208,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/64/b4208/\",\"shadow_value\":\"sarva-guhya-tamam – the most confidential of all; bhūyaḥ – again; śṛṇu – just hear; me – from Me; paramam – the supreme; vacaḥ – instruction; iṣṭaḥ asi – you are dear; me – to Me; dṛḍham – very; iti – thus; tataḥ – therefore; vakṣyāmi – I am speaking; te – for your; hitam – benefit.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"sarva-guhya-tamam\",\"translation\":\"the most confidential of all\"},{\"word\":\"bhūyaḥ\",\"translation\":\"again\"},{\"word\":\"śṛṇu\",\"translation\":\"just hear\"},{\"word\":\"me\",\"translation\":\"from Me\"},{\"word\":\"paramam\",\"translation\":\"the supreme\"},{\"word\":\"vacaḥ\",\"translation\":\"instruction\"},{\"word\":\"iṣṭaḥ asi\",\"translation\":\"you are dear\"},{\"word\":\"me\",\"translation\":\"to Me\"},{\"word\":\"dṛḍham\",\"translation\":\"very\"},{\"word\":\"iti\",\"translation\":\"thus\"},{\"word\":\"tataḥ\",\"translation\":\"therefore\"},{\"word\":\"vakṣyāmi\",\"translation\":\"I am speaking\"},{\"word\":\"te\",\"translation\":\"for your\"},{\"word\":\"hitam\",\"translation\":\"benefit\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4811,\"bb\":4209,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/64/b4209/\",\"body_value\":\"Because you are My very dear friend, I am speaking to you My supreme instruction, the most confidential knowledge of all. Hear this from Me, for it is for your benefit.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4812,\"bb\":4210,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/64/b4210/\",\"body_value\":\"The Lord has given Arjuna knowledge that is confidential (knowledge of Brahman) and still more confidential (knowledge of the Supersoul within everyone’s heart), and now He is giving the most confidential part of knowledge: just surrender unto the Supreme Personality of Godhead. At the end of the Ninth Chapter He has said, man-manāḥ: “Just always think of Me.” The same instruction is repeated here to stress the essence of the teachings of Bhagavad-gītā. This essence is not understood by a common man, but by one who is actually very dear to Kṛṣṇa, a pure devotee of Kṛṣṇa. This is the most important instruction in all Vedic literature. What Kṛṣṇa is saying in this connection is the most essential part of knowledge, and it should be carried out not only by Arjuna but by all living entities.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 18.64\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 18.64\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"29:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\